putPieceCostsIntoTable [SimTalk]
Writes the Piece costs, which the CostAnalyzer designated by <Path> computed, into the specified
DataTable.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.putPieceCostsIntoTable(DataTable:table)
Parameter
The parameter DataTable of data type table designates the DataTable into which Plant Simulation writes
the piece costs.
Example
CostAnalyzer.putPieceCostsIntoTable(MyPieceCosts)
SimTalk
getPieceCostsTable [SimTalk]
See also
Costs Shown in the Costs Report
